  ;; Others are 12-bit generation / 20-bit slot IDs scoped to one heap.
  ;; Control record: magic,pool,maxSlots,slots,freeSlots,cursor,freeBlocks,live,maxBytes,work,exceptionValue,exceptionPending, four weak Error prototypes, runtimeErrorKind, moduleExceptionValue, weak ReferenceError prototype, weak ProtocolDispatchError prototype, strong Object/Array prototypes (3 after close means weak rediscovery).
